            <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Spouse or partner of a Canadian</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Spousal sponsorship (inside or outside Canada)</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Prove the relationship is genuine; sponsor must be eligible</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Entrepreneur</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Provincial entrepreneur streams</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Federal Start-up Visa and Self-employed programs are paused</td></tr>
